#702 CONSOLIDATION BREAKOUT - DISCOVERY REPORT (D 2022-03-28 .. 2024-12-31). Exploratory: nothing here decides. The holdout is untouched.
source: trades_discovery.tsv.gz; table rows read 268; retrigger rows dropped 0.
A group is the MATURE walks only (a terminal exit, or the 120-session horizon with 121 forward sessions behind it); an open mark is counted in n_open and never enters a number.
BOOTSTRAP: month-block (calendar month of E), 2,000 resamples, seed 702; 95% interval. Terciles are cut on the discovery C0 distribution at the headline entry: dollar volume 50,000,000 / 50,000,000; ADR 0.1000 / 0.1000.
CONTROLS: ctl_family_a_settle = Family A's SETTLE_RULE (+1R half, +3R half, day-5 stop) on the same entry and stop; ctl_apollo_today = the live MAGNA53 ladder (+8 ORB-R partial, +3 ORB-R breakeven, depth trail) walked by live_fill_counterfactuals.walk_arm on the same entry and stop, anchored on the trade's own placed risk (1 placed-risk R = 2 ORB-R). Every arm's R is in units of fill - the entry's own stop.

